      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-08-14_WidnesExaminer_art0043" n="art0043">
        <head>ONE CONTROLLING INFLUENCE.</head>
        <p>ONE CONTROLLING INFLUENCE.</p>
        <p>Cov. • 111C1110r ARCHER supported the minutes, and Oftted for one authority, the Medical tin;" nf Health.. He should have the control- . 6 Influence over all the officials.</p>
